# Timestamped serverless.yml snapshots taken before manual edits.
# Kept on disk deliberately: several amplify-lambda/*.backup* files are the
# only surviving record of the CloudFormation logical IDs of the currently
# deployed stack (e.g. AccountingTable), which appear in neither the live
# file nor git history. Do not delete until that rename is reconciled.
*.backup
*.backup2
*.backup-*
